  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 403.06 Additional Reference for Hydraulic Determination. The department shall use the “Handbook of Hydraulics”, Eighth Edition, 2017, available as noted in Appendix B, in evaluating the competence of the submitted design.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
